operator: Lemme see that new seed a moment.
operator: Huh...
operator: Sacred lotus.
operator: These things tend to run warm.
operator: But with the Green Arsenal active, I'll bet they're downright *incandescent*.
operator: Shooting a seed through its flower oughta make it *burning* hot.
operator: And I suppose it could also be used for illumination in a pinch?
operator: Hopefully that helps you on your way, Gardener.
operator: Would you like to record any progress in your investigation?
- Yes
	operator: Saving progress...
	[signal arg="save_signal"]
	operator: Save complete.
	jump save_done
- No
	operator: Roger dodger! I'll be here if you need to save progress in the future.
	jump save_done
label save_done
operator: At that, I wish you the best of luck, Gardener.
And don't forget to keep an eye out for weak points!
[signal arg="scene_end_op"]
[end_timeline]